OL,3,GNEWSANI Secretary rules out
OL,4,A'front-loading' Stormont budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary has
OL,7,Fruled out 'front-loading' an extra
OL,8,F#1.5bn the UK government is proposing
OL,9,Fto give to the Stormont executive over
OL,10,Fthe next three years.
OL,12,FThe executive has not agreed a budget
OL,13,Ffor this year, blaming the UK's
OL,14,Fdevolution funding formula for leaving
OL,15,Fit short.
OL,17,FThe additional funding would be
OL,18,Freleased in three tranches with #525m
OL,19,Favailable this year.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
